companies, The Pokémon Company, or Discord.

ASSETS

assets/avatar.jpg and assets/avatar-source.jpg are a Pokémon Center product
photograph, included because the operator of this instance asked for it as the
bot's profile picture. They are NOT covered by the Apache License 2.0 that covers
the source code. Replace or remove them before redistributing this project.

PRIOR ART

Card Buddy is a separate, closed-source Discord bot by another author. This
project reproduces the same public information contract, meaning card art with set
and number, rules text, legality and prices, derived from that bot's documented
command behaviour. No source code, assets or data files from Card Buddy are
included here, and this project is not a fork of it.

Full dependency, data and image terms are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
